{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDExLS0yMDIwL0JpZyUyMEZpc2glMjAlMjYlMjBCZWdvbmlhJTIwJTI4MjAxNiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Big Fish & Begonia","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fRCdXh9MZutj1JJPZlUXMex6AuB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3WVhUsttN1uLyXhV33xCkONeFGA.jpg","description":"Beyond the human realm, there is a magical race of beings who control the tides and the changing of the seasons. One of these beings, a young girl named Chun, seeks something more—she wants to experience the human world! At sixteen, she finally gets her chance and transforms into a dolphin in order to explore the world that has her fascinated. But she soon discovers that it's a dangerous place and nearly gets killed in a vortex. Luckily, her life is spared when a young boy sacrifices himself to save her. Moved by his kindness and courage, she uses magic to bring him back to life only to learn that this power comes at a serious price. On a new adventure, she’ll have to make her own sacrifices in order to protect his soul until it is ready to return to the human world.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 8 Jul 2016 · China, South Korea · Language: Chinese · 101 min\nStudio: Studio Mir, Beijing Enlight Pictures, Horgos Coloroom Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: Chinese","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Animation","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"imdbRating":"7.3","runtime":"101 min","cast":["Ji Guanlin","Pan Shulan","Su Shangqing","Timmy Xu","King Shih-chieh","Jiu'er","Xang Yuanyuan","Xue Lifang"],"director":["Liang Xuan","Zhang Chun"],"released":"2016-07-08T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Two worlds. One destiny.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Liang Xuan","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jCbW8E5Q6NYyIQ5UcxfX1UuPT2m.jpg"},{"name":"Ji Guanlin","character":"Chun (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l0gh3dtxCloqdKZZ9NZnrm3kums.jpg"},{"name":"Pan Shulan","character":"Old Chun (voice)",